NO GAME DATA IS DISTRIBUTED HERE
================================

This repository contains original Go source code, documentation, and
screenshots of the running engine. It does not contain, and will not
contain:

  * the cartridge ROM image
  * graphics or sound data extracted from it (assets/**/*.bin)
  * the generated disassembly listing (docs/listing.asm)

All three are excluded by .gitignore. Users supply their own
legally-obtained cartridge image; the cmd/extract and cmd/disasm tools
rebuild everything else locally.

INTEROPERABILITY
================

The engine executes no Z80 machine code and embeds no copy of the
original program. Each routine was studied to determine its observable
behaviour and rewritten from scratch in Go, against an abstract hardware
interface, so that the game runs natively on modern operating systems.

